3204
03:33:43,950 --> 03:33:44,290
Thank you.

3205
03:33:44,390 --> 03:33:45,350
Dude, that was so sick.

3206
03:33:45,350 --> 03:33:47,030
Actually, the best run to end it on.

3207
03:33:49,750 --> 03:33:50,990
I'm an opinion former, yes.

3208
03:33:51,170 --> 03:33:51,750
I form opinions.

3209
03:33:52,850 --> 03:33:53,430
I do that.

3210
03:33:53,810 --> 03:33:54,650
